    "schema" "Sets the default search schema. Equivalent to setting search_path to a single value."
    "search_path" "Sets the default catalog search path as a comma-separated list of values."
    "secret_directory" "Set the directory in which persistent secrets are stored."
    "show_behavior" "Configures how SHOW resolves a bare identifier. 'auto' describes a table if one exists, else it describes a setting (deprecated). 'table' always describes a table, and 'setting' always describes a setting."
