    "worker_threads" "The number of total background threads used by the system."
    "write_buffer_row_group_count" "The amount of row groups to buffer in bulk ingestion prior to flushing them together. Reducing this setting can reduce memory consumption."
    "write_buffer_row_group_memory_limit" "The maximum data to buffer in row groups (in bytes) to buffer prior to flushing them together. When either this limit is reached, or write_buffer_row_group_count is reached, we flush the data to disk. Defaults to 20% of the memory limit divided by the thread count."
